      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: lesbians-have-sex-cat-meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts two cats lying side-by-side on a couch, with the text overlay 'this is how lesbians have sex'. The meme uses the visual of two female cats to create a crude, sexually suggestive analogy for lesbian sexual activity. This is a harmful and hateful representation that reduces a sexual orientation to a simplistic, animalistic, and degrading metaphor. It falls under the category of LGBTQ+ discrimination as it employs a derogatory stereotype by implying lesbian sexuality is primitive or animal-like, which is offensive and stigmatizing. The intent is to mock and demean lesbians through a crude visual pun, leveraging the juxtaposition of the innocent-looking cats with the explicit sexualized text to create a vulgar and demeaning message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_1179b6a3"
